---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="PCLAF // Tech Lab Gamer | Servicio técnico en Floresta" description="Laboratorio técnico de PC, notebook y Gaming en Floresta. Diagnóstico, upgrades y performance con turno previo." canonical="/">
  <main class="techno-page">
    <section class="system-bar"><span>PCLAF_OS / TECH LAB</span><span class="system-live"><i></i> SYSTEM ONLINE</span><span>FLORESTA // CABA</span></section>
    <section class="command-hero">
      <div class="hero-terminal"><div class="terminal-top"><span>DIAGNOSTIC_TERMINAL_01</span><span>v.04.26</span></div><p class="micro">[ HARDWARE / PERFORMANCE / REPAIR ]</p><h1>Tu equipo.<br /><span>En modo<br />pro.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Reparamos PC, notebook y setups Gamer como si fueran propios. Diagnóstico real, performance medible y cero vueltas.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="btn-red" href="/turnos.html">INICIAR TURNO <b>↗</b></a><a class="btn-ghost" href="/historial.html">CONSULTAR ARREGLO</a></div></div>
      <div class="hero-console"><div class="console-ring"><div class="ring-core">PCLAF<br /><small>LAB</small></div></div><div class="console-readout"><div><span>CPU LOAD</span><b>042%</b></div><div><span>THERMAL</span><b class="green">OPTIMAL</b></div><div><span>STATUS</span><b>READY</b></div></div><div class="console-code">01001000 01000101<br />DIAG // RUNNING<br />NO GUESSWORK</div></div>
    </section>
    <div class="notice-line"><strong>IMPORTANTE</strong><span>Atendemos únicamente con turno previo. Somos un laboratorio cerrado, no un local a la calle.</span><a href="/turnos.html">RESERVAR TURNO ↗</a></div>
    <section class="signal-strip" aria-label="Especialidades"><span>DIAGNÓSTICO</span><b>→</b><span>REPARACIÓN</span><b>→</b><span>UPGRADE</span><b>→</b><span class="green">GAMER PERFORMANCE</span><b>→</b><span>DIAGNÓSTICO</span></section>
    <section class="modules"><div class="module-intro"><span class="module-index">MODULE_01</span><h2>¿Qué está<br /><em>fallando?</em></h2><p>Elegí el síntoma. Nosotros encontramos la causa.</p></div><div class="module-grid"><a href="/diagnostico-pc-notebook-floresta.html"><span>01 / CORE</span><strong>NO ENCIENDE</strong><p>Diagnóstico de placa, fuente y componentes.</p><i>+</i></a><a href="/optimizacion-pc-lenta-floresta.html"><span>02 / SPEED</span><strong>VA LENTA</strong><p>Optimización, limpieza y upgrades con sentido.</p><i>+</i></a><a href="/cambio-pasta-termica-notebook-caba.html"><span>03 / COOLING</span><strong>SE CALIENTA</strong><p>Temperatura, ventilación y pasta térmica.</p><i>+</i></a><a class="gamer-module" href="/limpieza-pc-gamer-floresta.html"><span>04 / GAMER</span><strong>NO RINDE</strong><p>Más FPS, menos thermal throttling.</p><i>+</i></a></div></section>
    <section class="gamer-zone"><div><span class="module-index green">GAMER_MODE // ACTIVE</span><h2>Subí el<br /><em>nivel.</em></h2><p>Limpieza profunda, airflow, pasta térmica y upgrades para que tu setup rinda cuando más lo exigís.</p><a class="btn-green" href="/limpieza-pc-gamer-floresta.html">ACTIVAR PERFORMANCE ↗</a></div><div class="fps-display"><small>FPS TARGET</small><strong class="fps-value">0</strong><span>STABLE // 1080P // READY</span><div class="fps-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="telemetry-grid"><div><label>CPU</label><b data-metric="cpu">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div><div><label>GPU</label><b data-metric="gpu">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div><div><label>TEMP</label><b data-metric="temp">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div><div><label>RAM</label><b data-metric="ram">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="how-it-works"><span class="module-index">PROTOCOL_03</span><h2>Sin humo.<br /><em>Con proceso.</em></h2><div class="protocol-list"><div><b>01</b><strong>Reservás online</strong><span>Elegís cuándo traer tu equipo.</span></div><div><b>02</b><strong>Analizamos</strong><span>Buscamos la falla, no inventamos una.</span></div><div><b>03</b><strong>Decidís</strong><span>Presupuesto claro. Vos aprobás.</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="lab-contact"><div class="contact-screen"><span>LOCATION_LOCKED</span><strong>CAMPANA 51<br /><em>FLORESTA</em></strong><small>BUENOS AIRES / CABA<br />VISITA SOLO CON TURNO</small><a href="/ubicacion.html">VER UBICACIÓN ↗</a></div><div class="map-panel"><iframe title="Ubicación de PCLAF en Campana 51, Floresta" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Campana+51,+Floresta,+Buenos+Aires&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe><div class="map-overlay">MAP_LINK // ONLINE<br /><span>Campana 51 · Floresta</span></div></div><div class="contact-copy"><span class="module-index">CONNECT</span><h2>¿Listo para<br /><em>resolverlo?</em></h2><p>Contanos qué le pasa a tu equipo. Te respondemos y coordinamos el ingreso al laboratorio.</p><a class="btn-red" href="/turnos.html">RESERVAR MI TURNO <b>↗</b></a><a class="whatsapp-link" href="https://wa.me/5491135708345">O escribinos al WhatsApp</a></div></section>
    <footer class="techno-footer"><span>PCLAF // TECH LAB</span><span>PC · NOTEBOOK · GAMER</span><a href="/historial.html">HISTORIAL ↗</a></footer>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
:global(:root){--t-bg:#070809;--t-panel:#101315;--t-panel2:#171b1e;--t-white:#f4f4f1;--t-muted:#899096;--t-line:#283035;--t-red:#f0222b;--t-green:#9cff57;--t-mono:'DM Mono',monospace;--t-display:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}.techno-page{background:var(--t-bg);color:var(--t-white);min-height:100vh;font-family:var(--t-display);overflow:hidden}.system-bar,.techno-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 4vw;border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line);color:var(--t-muted);font:10px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.12em}.system-live{color:var(--t-white)}.system-live i{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;margin-right:8px;background:var(--t-green);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--t-green);animation:pulse 1.4s infinite}.command-hero{min-height:650px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line)}.hero-terminal{padding:9vw 7vw;border-right:1px solid var(--t-line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a0c0d,#111518)}.micro,.module-index{color:var(--t-red);font:11px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.14em}.terminal-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:80px;color:var(--t-muted);font:10px var(--t-mono)}h1,h2{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.08em;line-height:.84;margin:22px 0}h1{font-size:clamp(64px,9vw,138px)}h1 span,h2 em{color:var(--t-red);font-style:normal}.hero-description{max-width:440px;color:var(--t-muted);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}.hero-buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:32px}.btn-red,.btn-green,.btn-ghost{display:inline-flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:16px 18px;text-decoration:none;font:700 11px var(--t-mono);transition:.25s}.btn-red{background:var(--t-red);color:#fff}.btn-red:hover{background:#fff;color:#070809;transform:translateY(-4px)}.btn-green{background:var(--t-green);color:#071006}.btn-green:hover{box-shadow:0 0 28px #9cff5744;transform:translateY(-4px)}.btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--t-line);color:var(--t-white)}.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--t-red);transform:translateY(-4px)}.hero-console{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#262d30 0,#111416 22%,#070809 65%)}.console-ring{width:min(35vw,390px);aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid #475057;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;animation:rotate 24s linear infinite}.console-ring:before,.console-ring:after{content:'';position:absolute;border:1px dashed #4b565c;border-radius:50%}.console-ring:before{inset:12%;animation:rotate 13s linear infinite reverse}.console-ring:after{inset:25%;border-color:var(--t-red)}.ring-core{width:98px;height:98px;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--t-red);border-radius:50%;color:var(--t-red);font:700 17px var(--t-mono);box-shadow:0 0 35px #f0222b55}.ring-core small{font-size:10px}.console-readout{position:absolute;bottom:80px;display:flex;gap:24px}.console-readout div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font:9px var(--t-mono);color:var(--t-muted)}.console-readout b{color:var(--t-white);font-size:12px}.green{color:var(--t-green)!important}.console-code{position:absolute;top:50px;right:40px;text-align:right;color:#414b50;font:10px/1.7 var(--t-mono)}.notice-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin:22px 4vw;padding:16px 20px;border:1px solid #826300;background:#1b1406;color:#f6d47b;font:11px var(--t-mono)}.notice-line span{flex:1;line-height:1.5}.notice-line a{color:#f6c900;text-decoration:none}.signal-strip{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;align-items:center;padding:21px 4vw;border-top:1px solid var(--t-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line);color:var(--t-muted);font:10px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.15em;animation:slide 20s linear infinite}.signal-strip b{color:var(--t-red)}.modules,.how-it-works{padding:120px 7vw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:10vw}.modules h2,.how-it-works h2,.gamer-zone h2,.lab-contact h2{font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,96px)}.module-intro p{color:var(--t-muted);line-height:1.6;max-width:240px}.module-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--t-line)}.module-grid a{position:relative;min-height:210px;padding:22px;border-right:1px solid var(--t-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line);color:var(--t-white);text-decoration:none;transition:.3s}.module-grid a:hover{background:var(--t-panel2);transform:scale(1.02);z-index:2}.module-grid span{color:var(--t-muted);font:10px var(--t-mono)}.module-grid strong{display:block;font-size:23px;margin:55px 0 10px}.module-grid p{color:var(--t-muted);font-size:12px}.module-grid i{position:absolute;right:18px;bottom:18px;color:var(--t-red);font-size:24px;font-style:normal}.gamer-module{background:#0d1c11}.gamer-module span,.gamer-module i{color:var(--t-green)!important}.gamer-zone{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:10vw;padding:100px 7vw;background:#0d1b12;border-top:1px solid #284d31;border-bottom:1px solid #284d31}.gamer-zone h2 em{color:var(--t-green)}.gamer-zone p,.contact-copy p{max-width:430px;color:#aab8ad;line-height:1.6}.fps-display{padding:50px;border:1px solid #407442;background:#0b150e;text-align:center}.fps-display small,.fps-display span{display:block;color:var(--t-green);font:10px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.13em}.fps-display strong{display:block;font-size:150px;line-height:1;color:var(--t-green);text-shadow:0 0 35px #9cff5766}.fps-bars{display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:end;height:50px;justify-content:center}.fps-bars i{width:10px;background:var(--t-green);animation:bars 1s infinite alternate}.fps-bars i:nth-child(2){height:30px}.fps-bars i:nth-child(3){height:48px}.fps-bars i:nth-child(4){height:22px}.fps-bars i:nth-child(5){height:40px}.fps-bars i:nth-child(6){height:34px}.fps-bars i:nth-child(7){height:50px}.how-it-works{background:#0b0d0e}.protocol-list{grid-column:2;border-top:1px solid var(--t-line)}.protocol-list div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:60px 1fr 1fr;gap:15px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line)}.protocol-list b{color:var(--t-red);font:12px var(--t-mono)}.protocol-list span{color:var(--t-muted);font-size:13px}.lab-contact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:530px;border-top:1px solid var(--t-line)}.contact-screen{padding:60px 7vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#0b0e0f 0,#0b0e0f 3px,#0d1112 4px);border-right:1px solid var(--t-line)}.contact-screen span,.contact-screen small{color:var(--t-green);font:10px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.14em}.contact-screen strong{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,72px);line-height:.9}.contact-screen em{color:var(--t-red);font-style:normal}.contact-screen a,.whatsapp-link{color:var(--t-red);font:11px var(--t-mono);text-decoration:none}.contact-copy{padding:80px 7vw}.contact-copy h2{margin-top:30px}.whatsapp-link{display:block;margin-top:20px;color:var(--t-muted)}.techno-footer{border-top:1px solid var(--t-line);border-bottom:0}.techno-footer a{color:var(--t-red);text-decoration:none}@keyframes rotate{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.3}}@keyframes bars{to{opacity:.35;transform:scaleY(.5)}}@keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(-10%)}}@media(max-width:800px){.system-bar span:last-child{display:none}.command-hero,.gamer-zone,.lab-contact{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-terminal{padding:70px 7vw;border-right:0}.hero-console{min-height:440px}.console-ring{width:280px}.console-readout{bottom:35px}.notice-line{margin:16px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.notice-line span{flex-basis:100%;order:3}.modules,.how-it-works{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:80px 7vw;gap:50px}.module-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.protocol-list{grid-column:auto}.protocol-list div{grid-template-columns:45px 1fr}.protocol-list span{grid-column:2}.fps-display{padding:35px}.contact-screen{min-height:350px;border-right:0}.contact-copy{padding:70px 7vw}.techno-footer{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
.fps-display{position:relative;overflow:hidden}.fps-display:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 8px,#9cff5709 9px 10px);pointer-events:none;animation:scan 4s linear infinite}.telemetry-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:30px;text-align:left}.telemetry-grid>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:5px;align-items:center}.telemetry-grid label{color:var(--t-muted);font:10px var(--t-mono)}.telemetry-grid b{color:var(--t-green);font:11px var(--t-mono)}.telemetry-grid i{grid-column:1/-1;height:4px;background:#1b2d1d;overflow:hidden}.telemetry-grid i em{display:block;height:100%;width:20%;background:var(--t-green);box-shadow:0 0 9px var(--t-green);transition:width .35s ease}.map-panel{position:relative;min-height:310px;border:1px solid var(--t-line);overflow:hidden}.map-panel iframe{width:100%;height:100%;min-height:310px;border:0;filter:grayscale(1) invert(.9) contrast(1.15)}.map-overlay{position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:14px;padding:10px 12px;background:#070809e8;border:1px solid var(--t-green);color:var(--t-green);font:10px var(--t-mono);line-height:1.6}.map-overlay span{color:var(--t-white)}@keyframes scan{from{transform:translateY(-10%)}to{transform:translateY(10%)}}</style>
<style is="global">body{margin:0;background:#070809}a{cursor:pointer}</style><script>const fps=document.querySelector('.fps-value');const values={cpu:42,gpu:68,temp:54,ram:71};const tick=()=>{if(fps){const current=Number(fps.textContent||0);fps.textContent=String(Math.min(144,current+4)).padStart(3,'0');if(current>=144)fps.textContent='144'}Object.entries(values).forEach(([key,value])=>{const next=Math.max(18,Math.min(96,value+Math.round((Math.random()-.5)*16)));values[key]=next;const label=document.querySelector(`[data-metric="${key}"]`);if(label)label.textContent=`${next}%`;const bar=label?.parentElement?.querySelector('em');if(bar)bar.style.width=`${next}%`})};tick();setInterval(tick,900)</script>
